            "review_title": "Review at Lau Ca Keo Ba Huyen",
            "review_text": "Petitgiaco\nChambery, France477 contributions\n0\nA tasty address\nMay 2024 • Couples\nTypical Vietnamese restaurant, no tourists… in the evening, the temple is closed. Coming regularly to this address, I can say, contrary to some opinions, that the hot pot is tasty and... delicious. The mango salad with small shrimp, the fried squid and the grilled fish were really good. Finally this is an address that you MUST try and which is very clean: we are in Vietnam\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten May 11, 2024",
