            "review_title": "Review at Lau Ca Keo Ba Huyen",
            "review_text": "Navigate31105306244\n1 contribution\n0\nVery bad. 1 star attitude. Disappointed with the customer service attitude\nMar 2024 • Friends\nI heard the attitude of the short, fat male manager, the owner's nephew, is very bad. Look down on customers. Coarse. Loudly demanding customers when they request to meet with higher management. Two people are not allowed to sit in air conditioning. Ask me and my friends to go somewhere else. Or have to separate tables. My friend and I disagree. The restaurant had a lot of empty seats at that time. Lots of tables for 2 people. Too hospitable, impolite and unprofessional. If you hit a customer, you will have to go to the ward. Very bad attitude.\nRead more\nService\nShow original\nWritten April 8, 2024",
