            "review_title": "Review at Lau Ca Keo Ba Huyen",
            "review_text": "itineranti2015\nKuching, Malaysia48 contributions\n0\ngo local go\nJan 2020\ni ate here after a visit to the next door temple. The food was tasty, hot, served quickly and the portions were generous. I ordered from the menu , provided in english or vietnamese. There was lots of choice , veggies, meats, ricey and soups. One waitress spoke good english and was kind, smiled and willing to change the drinks after a misunderstanding over what I ordered. \nI went at lunch time.There were lots of spaces and seats. If I had gone in the evening I would have had to queue and wait for a seat because this place is popular because it does a first class hot pot or steamboat or cook your own stuff in a big pot . \nPrices ? not the cheapest, not luxury rip off.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 27, 2020",
