            "review_text": "On the road\n134 contributions\n0\nstress food\nJan 2018 • Friends\nFish! who like the fish can come hier and except the place look not very clean, but all stress food in Vietnam the same, even in the south more celan than the north, service also better. Dont drink seomthign with ice, but can order fish , special small fish name KEO, in the north call CHACH. grill with salt and chili, swort fish grill with salt and chilli very good in hier, all and all served in small dish, the you can order one hot pot, but remind them make the fish dead in the kitchen, not make the food show in front of you.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 31, 2018",
